{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Armor & Helmets|Plate Ga$untlets}}

{{PAGENAME}} are a piece of high-end hand [[:Category:Armor|armor]] which also reduce chance for damage associated with handling [[Crab]]s, [[Hedgehog]]s and also reduces chance for [[Seal Finger]] when butchering [[Walrus|Walrii]] or [[Grey Seal|Grey Seals]].<br>
It equips to the [[Equipment Screen|equipment slot]] 5L.

==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Steel+ _{q}Leather}{2} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>.

